<noinclude>Infrastructure for wiki-based poll
== Usage==
<nowiki>{{#widget:</nowiki>{{PAGENAME}}<nowiki>|options=xxxx}}</nowiki>

== options ==

Options is a comma separated list of options defining the poll that immediately follows the widget:

;voters
:show number of users that answered this question
;count
:show absolute count for each response
;percent
:show percentage for each response

('''N.B.''' Only one of '''count''' and '''percent''' can be used for a particular poll instance.)

